Hi Dan,

If I'm not mistaken, I think you want to fit a standard closed-population capture-recapture model. I just wrote a vignette describing how to fit such models, and include covariates of abundance. If you have version 0.9-5, type:

vignette("cap-recap")

Once you estimate abundance, it is easy to convert that to an estimate of occupancy.

Richard

