Subject: Distance Sampling Stratification - small-area estimation, estimating random effects, prediction in distance sampling, non-overlapping replicates
Message-ID: <RztphvFiH-0.LwNLOsQ5eB4J@unmarked.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/unmarked/c/RztphvFiH-0/m/LwNLOsQ5eB4J>
